Package: magnolie-organizer-akonadi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, akonadi-server,
 magnolie-organizer (>= 2.0.16)
Recommends: kdepim-runtime
Description: KDE system-account bridge for Magnolie Organizer
 This optional helper lets Magnolie Organizer use calendars and address books
 already configured in KDE Akonadi. It communicates through a bounded local
 protocol and never receives account credentials.
